hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"157","It is narrated from Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (may Allah be pleased with him) that the Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""Whoever fasts during Ramadan with faith and seeking reward, his previous sins are forgiven."""
"158","It is narrated from Sayyiduna Abu Hurairah (may Allah be pleased with him) that the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said: ""Whoever stands (in prayer) during Ramadan with faith and seeking reward, his previous sins are forgiven."""
